    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντροπᾰλ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντρέπω,</span>
		only pres.
		part., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>often
				turning round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλοχος δὲ φίλη οἶκόνδε βεβήκει
					ἐντροπαλιζομένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.496
				</span></i>
			; esp. of men retreating with their face to the enemy, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρὶ ἐοικώς, ἐντροπαλιζόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.547
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.492
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.583
			</span></i>.</div>
